         menu (switch with the menu / Ctrl+Space; "off" = pick ABC). The
         controller maps "<bundle id>.<method>" to the engine method.
         build_app.sh appends one mode per bundled keyboards/*.toml by copying
         the telex entry, so keep telex the template. -->
